<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Payment verification</title><style>body{background:#f4f7fb;color:#14263d;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}.card{max-width:660px;margin:70px auto;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce5ef;border-radius:20px;padding:32px}.badge{display:inline-block;padding:7px 11px;border-radius:20px;background:#fff0cc;color:#76510b;font-weight:800}.status{font-size:28px;text-transform:capitalize}.ok{color:#176b4d}.warn{color:#a56a11}a{display:inline-block;margin-top:18px;padding:12px 17px;border-radius:10px;background:#176b4d;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800}</style></head><body><main class="card"><span class="badge">BANK TEST ENVIRONMENT</span><h1>Payment inquiry completed</h1><p class="status {{ $transaction->status === 'verified' ? 'ok' : 'warn' }}">{{ str_replace('_',' ',$transaction->status) }}</p><p>The browser return was not trusted by itself. The application queried MPGS server-to-server before displaying this status.</p>@if(!$indicatorMatches)<p>The return indicator was missing or did not match. Server inquiry remains authoritative.</p>@endif @if($transaction->failure_message)<p>{{ $transaction->failure_message }}</p>@endif <a href="/my-ledger">Return to my challans</a>@if($transaction->status==='verified') <a href="{{ route('bank.receipt',$transaction->public_id) }}">Print receipt</a>@endif</main></body></html>
